{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For modern-day monsters, world domination no longer comes through sheer power; you need brains, wit, and a ton of capital. The lazy shark-man Biff Steaks has none of that, nor the desire to take over the world, yet one horrible day leads him to become a key target in an ongoing battle between warring conglomerates! If he ever wants his normal life back, he'll have to take it to the top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/dbb19a98a3e335431d246f2296bac0af.poster.avif?t=1752104913\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/dbb19a98a3e335431d246f2296bac0af.gif?t=1752104913\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through armies of goons and unique bosses in a variety of levels! Bottom-Up Beatdown: Hostile Takeover combines the chaos of classic 2D beat em' ups with the freeform combat systems of character action games. Battle through unique environments led by their distinct bosses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/2d53f696b588f0544e555d3e47fb8a1c.poster.avif?t=1752104913\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/2d53f696b588f0544e555d3e47fb8a1c.webm?t=1752104913\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/2d53f696b588f0544e555d3e47fb8a1c.mp4?t=1752104913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready for some overtime?\u00a0Play co-op and enjoy some quality bonding time shooting for high scores in multiple arenas or go for the best time in boss rush mode! Select from a pool of eccentric characters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/c28c59d593402b8331b1c91f41583ce9.poster.avif?t=1752104913\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/c28c59d593402b8331b1c91f41583ce9.gif?t=1752104913\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to escape this corporate conspiracy, you'll have to make some allies and enemies along the way. You'll have to work with Sue Flay, a mysterious agent of Mask Corporation, who guarantees your freedom once you take down their rivals at the Third Eye Network. It's all uphill from here...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822860?t=1752104913","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822860?t=1752104913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/f9229d6ff0997539027c088ae46393ed8d600dd1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752104913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/f9229d6ff0997539027c088ae46393ed8d600dd1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752104913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Parti