raph\">Ready for some overtime?\u00a0Play co-op and enjoy some quality bonding time shooting for high scores in multiple arenas or go for the best time in boss rush mode! Select from a pool of eccentric characters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/c28c59d593402b8331b1c91f41583ce9.poster.avif?t=1752104913\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/c28c59d593402b8331b1c91f41583ce9.gif?t=1752104913\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to escape this corporate conspiracy, you'll have to make some allies and enemies along the way. You'll have to work with Sue Flay, a mysterious agent of Mask Corporation, who guarantees your freedom once you take down their rivals at the Third Eye Network. It's all uphill from here...</p>","developers":["Bugzsteaks"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/736ed1b6ed1633581ceea78ea31066d24129b00b/header.jpg?t=1752104913","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257164830,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164830/movie480.mp4?t=1752104911","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164830/movie_max.mp4?t=1752104911"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257164830/6a58ddf8143e11d8120bb9a797842363afd40679/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752104911","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164830/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752104911","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164830/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752104911"}}],"name":"Bottom-Up Beatdown: Hostile 